Root Next.js TypeScript app: `src` App Router; components `src/components`; hooks `src/hooks`; utilities `src/lib`; routes `src/app`; API `src/app/api/*`; assets `public/`; scripts `scripts/`; Vite `vite-base-template/`.
`npm run dev`; `npm run build`; `npm run start`; `npm run lint`; `cd vite-base-template && npm run dev`; `npm --prefix vite-base-template run build`.
Strict TS, `noEmit: true`; `@/*` → `src/*`; ESLint `eslint.config.mjs`;
